1
00:00:00,319 --> 00:00:02,587
Jackal, Stage 3.

2
00:00:02,617 --> 00:00:06,017
A battleship is docked at the end of the harbor.

3
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,400
Six turrets,

4
00:00:07,514 --> 00:00:07,400
and you take them out one by one.

5
00:00:07,978 --> 00:00:09,866
The last one blows,

6
00:00:09,896 --> 00:00:12,806
and the whole ship burns and sinks.

7
00:00:12,836 --> 00:00:14,640
If you like this kind of fight,

8
00:00:14,793 --> 00:00:14,640
leave a like.

9
00:00:15,213 --> 00:00:19,088
This is the most-played of my remakes,

10
00:00:19,118 --> 00:00:21,960
but it only ever had two stages.

11
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:24,871
So I followed the original Stage 3 map

12
00:00:25,256 --> 00:00:24,871
and built the whole harbor.

13
00:00:25,447 --> 00:00:28,617
The first build was a bit of a joke:

14
00:00:28,647 --> 00:00:32,068
every arrow on the ground came out as a letter Y,

15
00:00:32,098 --> 00:00:34,587
the sea was as bright as a swimming pool,

16
00:00:34,688 --> 00:00:34,587
and the ship's bridge was a black blob.

17
00:00:35,163 --> 00:00:36,555
After the fixes,

18
00:00:36,585 --> 00:00:38,281
it finally looks like a harbor.

19
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,773
I also found an old problem:

20
00:00:41,803 --> 00:00:44,591
a new player who just stands still

21
00:00:44,621 --> 00:00:45,136
gets killed in eight seconds.

22
00:00:45,714 --> 00:00:47,404
Now, until you move,

23
00:00:47,434 --> 00:00:49,617
the enemies hold their fire,

24
00:00:49,647 --> 00:00:51,220
and a hint shows you how to drive.

25
00:00:51,798 --> 00:00:54,113
Back to the stage.

26
00:00:54,143 --> 00:00:57,294
Two piers run side by side into the sea,

27
00:00:57,324 --> 00:00:59,830
gunboats shoot at you from both sides,

28
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:00,451
and a tank blocks the other pier.

29
00:01:01,029 --> 00:01:04,782
Don't ignore the parked jeeps.

30
00:01:04,812 --> 00:01:06,479
Blow this one up

31
00:01:06,509 --> 00:01:07,010
and there's a star hidden inside.

32
00:01:07,588 --> 00:01:11,084
The hardest part is the zigzag between the warehouses:

33
00:01:11,114 --> 00:01:13,836
cannons line the walls,

34
00:01:13,866 --> 00:01:14,986
and this run got wrecked here once.

35
00:01:15,562 --> 00:01:19,051
Get all twelve prisoners onto the helicopter,

36
00:01:19,081 --> 00:01:21,619
blow open the last gate,

37
00:01:21,698 --> 00:01:21,619
and you reach the dock.

38
00:01:22,195 --> 00:01:24,757
Press C for the low camera,

39
00:01:24,787 --> 00:01:26,546
and the harbor stands right in front of you.

40
00:01:27,122 --> 00:01:29,372
Stage 3 is live.

41
00:01:29,402 --> 00:01:32,318
It runs in the browser on desktop and phone;

42
00:01:32,348 --> 00:01:34,815
the link is in the description.

43
00:01:34,845 --> 00:01:36,836
The original has six stages.

44
00:01:36,866 --> 00:01:37,834
Which one should come next?

45
00:01:39,404 --> 00:01:37,834
Tell me in the comments.
